1. W3C material

The ACT test cases (https://www.w3.org/WAI/content-assets/wcag-act-rules/testcases.json, linked
from https://www.w3.org/WAI/standards-guidelines/act/rules/) are downloaded at run time, and the
test pages themselves are not included in this repository. The run outputs kept here,
docs/models/runs/*/results.jsonl and summary.json, bench/results/ and test/fixtures/runs/,
include material copied from them: ACT rule names, test case titles and addresses, and short
quotes of the test pages in the messages and evidence of findings. They were produced by
rampa eval and by the benchmark in bench/.

The judgment prompts (src/criteria/) and the MCP server's guide (src/mcp/guide.ts) quote short
normative passages of WCAG 2.1 (https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/) and WCAG 2.2
(https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/), and the titles of some WCAG Techniques.

The ACT test cases: Copyright © 2026 W3C® (MIT, ERCIM, Keio, Beihang).
